  "description": "This protocol automates a multi-wash virus isolation using magnetic beads and a magnetic module GEN2. It contains custom shakes in between transfers to release any droplets on the end of the pipette tips.\n\n\nTo purchase tips, reagents, or pipettes, please visit our online store or contact our sales team at info@opentrons.com\n\nOpentrons OT-2\nOpentrons P300 GEN2 Multi-Channel Pipette\nOpentrons 200µL Filter Tips\nUSA Scientific 12-Well Reservoir, 22ml\nOpentrons Magnetic Module (GEN2)\nNEST 96 Well Plate 2000 µL",
